# Next.js renderer build output produced by verify.sh (render_nextjs.py -o).
# Regenerable in one command, and it embeds a COPY of renderer/public/brand —
# committing it would smuggle brand-owned photography into git through the back
# door after we deliberately gitignored the originals. The validation report and
# gate-results.json for this build ARE tracked; the build artifact is not.
reports/m6-renderer-site/
